{
  "//": "The Scope string form (plan §13.3), shared by scope/scope_test.go (Go: scope.Scope.String, scope.Parse) and studio/web/src/lib/scope.test.ts (web: serializeScope, parseScope). roundtrip: serialise scope to string, parse string back to scope. serialize: serialise only (the parse side drops what it wrote as unset). parse: parse only (the lenient reader). Keys are the web Scope's: publicId, session, flow, run.",
  "roundtrip": [
